#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/rituals.json
msgid ""
"With the help of a telepathic focusing tool and your (hopefully) extensive "
"telepathic powers, you can sink into a deep trance where you can only sense "
"yourself, allowing you to permanently adjust your mental state and view of "
"the outside world.  Will the end result still be you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/rituals.json
