"You've done it.  After long effort, you've mastered the VERDANT HAND "
"protocols.  Bring on the zombies; you'll smash them to pieces with your "
"fists."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNLOCK_PSIONIC_COMBAT_2" in
